watchOS 27 will reportedly include new watch faces, including <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/05/04/watchos-27-expected-to-have-new-watch-faces/">a variant of the "Modular Ultra" watch face</a> that is currently exclusive to the Apple Watch Ultra.<br/>
